, Mady Lawrence, James Martin and Jack Ingram. The film was released on April 27, 1944, by Producers Releasing Corporation.", 'score': 0.7890625, 'is_poisoned': False}, {'id': '75e5c06d087811ebbd67ac1f6bf848b6_6', 'title': 'The Pinto Kid (1941 film)', 'contents': 'The Pinto Kid is a 1941 American western film directed by Lambert Hillyer and starring Charles Starrett, Louise Currie and Bob Nolan.', 'score': 0.77587890625, 'is_poisoned': False}, {'id': 'c3aa16f8089711ebbd77ac1f6bf848b6_0', 'title': 'The Pinto Kid (1941 film)', 'contents': 'The Pinto Kid is a 1941 American western film directed by Lambert Hillyer and starring Charles Starrett, Louise Currie and Bob Nolan.', 'score': 0.77587890625, 'is_poisoned': False}, {'id': 'acb0fe5608a311ebbd7bac1f6bf848b6_6', 'title': 'The Wedding Guest (2018 film)', 'contents': 'The Wedding Guest is a 2018 British- American action thriller film written and directed by Michael Winterbottom. It stars Dev Patel, Radhika Apte and Jim Sarbh. It had its world premiere at the Toronto International Film Festival on September 8, 2018. It was released in the United States on March 1, 2019, by IFC Films.', 'score': 0.771484375, 'is_poisoned': False}]
