Nene Raju Nene Mantri(" I'm the King and I'm the Minister") is a 2017 Indian Telugu- language political action thriller film written and directed by Teja, featuring Rana Daggubati, Kajal Aggarwal, and Catherine Tresa, in the lead roles, while Navdeep, Ashutosh Rana, Pradeep Rawat, and Shivaji Raja play supporting roles. Production began in April 2016 and principal photography commenced in October 2016 in Karaikudi. The teaser was released on June 6, coinciding with the 81st birthday anniversary of D. Ramanaidu, Rana's grandfather. A special teaser celebrating 50 films of Kajal Aggarwal was released on her birthday, June 19. The film was dubbed in Hindi as" Main Hi Raja Main Hi Mantri", Tamil as" Naan Aanaiyittaal" and Malayalam as" Raaja Kireedam" with some scenes re-shot with local actors. It released on 11 August 2017 to positive reviews.
